# The mini and the old lab's host, as you reach them. The repository names
# neither: the scripts that need one read it from the environment or, when
# it is not set there, from deploy/mini.conf beside this file. mini.conf is
# not committed: copy this file to it and put your own values in. Plain
# NAME=value lines, no quotes. Nothing here is a secret. The values here are
# empty: a copy left unchanged is refused, not taken for a host.

# The mini's address on the LAN, reserved on the router: the only address
# the backup guest's rest-server answers (scripts/mini/guest/setup --mini),
# as four numbers.
MACLAB_MINI_ADDRESS=

# The old lab's host as SSH reaches it: your account there and its name
# (scripts/cutover/old-lab --from), as USER@HOST.
MACLAB_OLD_LAB=
